    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giinealshoodiga ng'uyeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarina jeeda buuneeda sibanga ng'uyeega earapeadi jea gwanda giinealshoodiga ng'uyeega aba jeedeang'wa, fuga jea gweadu giinealshooda nyariida aba makcheameeda, ak ghwashaang' Siida haw ghayi shaang' saawa, ak gweasa geat nyariida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga saang'a gayghwaat geeshta hiseadayeanduumeeda nyaawa, nea aba badahuuka nyaawa gayghwadaajiit naweeda huumeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba shidooda nyaawa bea ghaang' gaygooheadeesa haleanjeeda aba badahuukeagwa aba ng'asheega ng'uyeega; ghang'eada garayi girgweageeda nyaawa ghanyea maygafuuf, nea nyariida nyaawa ghanyea maygwalil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ASEETA ghayi iimwanung'waada malaykajeega adiiy, hean gwahisa jeeda maloonghajeega ak ghwayiin jeesinga shoomeanga misana earassa ea ghwahita eaweeda girgweaksiinda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny ghayi iimwanung'waada ng'eanyiida ghayi bea garayi ak ghoaghu Nuhu, was siida doabiiwaat, sea fih ispwa, damanda eana roopta gituunuwaas badayda ng'eanyiida fuga mabata ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea iiyam mujiinajeega Sodoma ea Gomora, ak ghwanung' ghoah deareeda ak ghwaaga ghoorjooda saawa ak gwanuuseada nea ghwanung' ghoah gichea eegala aba heeda fuga mabata ASEETEAN; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iing'ata nea gwalealu Lutuheeda doabiiwaat, gagiisan muuchi aba hiseadayeanduumeeda fuga munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadaah naaha siidida doabiiwaadiin ak ghwayiiy naaha damanda mideewa jeenyaawa, iissa geenyareas aba jeadaanyi doabiiwaat galeaga sean aba sinaweega nyaawa maweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi Ng'utamiida ghwanal gichea gwalealdeayda fuga awali gheang'da ASEETA aba jeeda simsimda, nea ghwayiin fuga mii doobiiweadi ghoamuughu ghealooda ea ghwahita eaweeda girgweaksiinda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghwaraanya giika aat geeshta ng'asheega gasa saseeda aba gasooda ng'asheega munyasiin nea gafool gheambalmeedean. Daruuschi mideawa uurjeenga meawala giing'weaka haleanjeeda gheambiideadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea eara malaykajeega earapeadi hees ak ea majeekcheewiin, ghanyea mii goong'eawi girgweageeda aba badahuuka nyaawa aba madeeda Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea suh, gawuurji diyeanga manda fughareenga, diyeanga nal haleanjeeda sean, ghayi sijiilsa gideaba gajeang'waay ak geenuus, ang'eawi haleanjeeda mwanala, ak gajealas uhuuda aba nyariida sea saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwasawana aba giidiinyeanda aba giidiinyeanda nyaawa. Ak ghwanung' ghoah miyeenooda leeshooda askwearda. Asi gwandeawa washta ea agita badayda, gwaleeshi nea gwareengani geat, aba jeeda ghweelmeeda nyaawa bea leeshooda sea agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheanyanga nyaawa ghwanyiit hiseadayeanduumeeda, ak ea malang'uuta aba riing'eeda. Iissa gwareengani jeesinga ng'arng'ari. Ak gwandeawa gurooruunatka siinaal shidoodeaba ghaang'. Diibiga simwaashta! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanung'usa heeda naweeda doabiiwaat, ak gwarooda; ak ghwaat naweeda Balaamu was orjeeda Beori, ghayi bwariiy nyasooda gidageatinda muy aba naweeda mwadoabiiwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak niny geewoowsa aba giidiinyeandaanyi; digeeda manda ghuuta baloolda siida ak ghoadeal geeska sibaneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu gawuurji gheanyanga eenda manda beega, ak gawuurji gicha dung'usta ghuuta jeameeda, ak giibinda nyaawa ea siyiin heeda misana muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba iissa gwarugu ng'asheega hees bea ghwarjeeda, aba haleanjeeda gasa saseeda aba munyinda iissa gwareengani buuneeda mang'awa heeda fuga abiida jeeda ramaseanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeessa gwaheeleesa sea buuneeda gideaba gay ghwanyas giibaldeaba geat, nea ghana saawa ea giing'oonyanga sina ng'asheega munyas gil; aba gideaba gidajoar siida, abeeda gayghoah giing'oonyaneedeaba gidida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba, fugiga iiniibuut ririnnyeanda muunda ng'eanyiida, aba gideaba ninal Ng'utamiideanya ea lealnoocheanda was Yesu Gristo, iighas gicha ng'asheega ak geajoar, abeeda huuydeanda eaweega nyaawa gaygamunyiit ea ghwanaawa diita bea madeedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghang'wana gwachi ea mwanala naweedida doabiiwaadiin mwasamwa gideaba ghwanal ak iidu ghwanung'wa heeda diigheandida ghaydit siitawiin saawaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gawuurji sea ng'asheanda sirukuta aba ghwasiildeanga ghayi bea huumwa, bea gideaba, Gudeeda nibiiksa geeseegaaschi, ak nuut gicha geeyeesha, ukurmeeda siihuun nibiikta goobeerbeershi aba jeeda sheang'weeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
